{"game": "elden-ring-nightreign", "language": "english", "appid": 2622380, "month": "2026-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1784160000, "end_date": 1784851199, "month_true_total": 1106, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-04 23:47:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "231160852", "author": {"steamid": "76561198338936877", "personaname": "Uglyboi85", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198338936877/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 6734, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2168, "last_played": 1788717479, "avatar": "b9657116e5a5cfe18f1c8b1ad28d9c72f625f417"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game sucks ♥♥♥♥! The enemies are so broken and overpowered that you don't even stand a chance! There is no chance of surivability everywhre you go. No matter what you do or what weapon you get, the enemies will still kick your ass. Especially the bosses, they all have moves that will kill you in one shot. I can't describe how ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ and broken this game is for the players. There is no window of vunerability, even if you get knock down, you still getting your ass beat as you're laying there and getting up. On top of that the animations are so slow before you can start to fight again so in the meantime you are doing as your stupid hero tries to snap him self back in the moment. Game is stupid rtarded. I would not reccommend to anyone that is happy in life - this game will bring on symptons of pain you never even had. I now get unusual migraines I never had and more stress that my blood pressure has spiked. This game will make your life hell so I would not reccomend this trash game!", "timestamp_created": 1784850783, "timestamp_updated": 1784850783, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 7, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504927515983581543", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": fa